  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">T&#xfc;rkiye earthquake response 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&#x2019;s humanitarian response to the February 2023 earthquakes in T&#xfc;rkiye.  Lifesaving assistance to affected populations and support for early recovery through funding to International Federation of the Red Cross (IFRC) and Turkish Red Crescent (TRC), deployment of an Australian Disaster Assistance Response Team (DART) including urban search and rescue (USAR) experts supported by Humanitarian Logistics Capability (HLC) and funding to Australian Humanitarian Partnership (AHP) Australian non-government organisations Save the Children and World Vision including local partners.  Support includes access to protection, food, shelter, and emergency supplies to assist people in vulnerable situations - especially women, children and people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
